<title>CHINA: Taiwan investment in Shanghai reaches $5.5 billion.</title>
<headline>Taiwan investment in Shanghai reaches $5.5 billion.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of Taiwan-invested firms in Shanghai at the end of November reached 2,825, with total contracted investment of $5.54 billion, the Wen Hui Bao newspaper reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Of the total, 310 are investments in electronic projects, with contracted investment of $314 million, it said.</p>
</text>
